<title>USA: Scholastic Corp acquires Lectorum.</title>
<headline>Scholastic Corp acquires Lectorum.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scholastic Corp said on Friday it has acquired Lectorum, the largest distributor and retailer of Spainish books in the United States.</p>
<p>Lectorum, which markets books primarily to schools and libraries, will operate as a wholly-owned subsidiary reporting to Scholastic's children's book group and be managed as a separate operation, Scholastic said.</p>
<p>The terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
